# Networking Task

Task: Tune kernel network parameters on this server.

Set the following kernel parameters:

- `net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies` = `{{tcp_syncookies}}`
- `net.core.somaxconn` = `{{somaxconn}}`
- `net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout` = `{{tcp_fin_timeout}}`

The values must be active on the running system and must persist across reboots via a configuration file in `/etc/sysctl.d/`.
